  "description": "Find the sum of widths of all subsequences of an array. Width is defined as max - min.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. nums.sort((a, b) => a - b)\n2. n = nums.length\n3. sum = 0, p = 1\n4. for i from 0 to n-1:\n5.   sum = (sum + nums[i] * p - nums[n-1-i] * p) % MOD\n6.   p = (p * 2) % MOD",
